  "description": {
   "en": "Edogawa Ranpo's masterpiece short stories \"The Man Who Travels with Oshie,\" \"The Air-raid Shelter,\" \"The Red Room,\" and \"Dr. Mera\" are beautifully depicted by Kanako Inuki, the queen of horror manga! The entire story is told from Dr. Merahakase's point of view, a fresh and original approach to this book of her best work! The long-awaited unpublished work is finally available in e-book format!\n\n80P Omnibus Oneshot from Shoujo Friend Suspense \u0026 Horror: Winter of 1996, digital version split into 2 volumes for some reason."
  },
